+
+  Actions: canary_promote, kms_alias_swap, model_promote, fl_round
+
+  Invariants:
+    - KMS swaps require approvals_map["kms_alias_swap"] >= req (eg 2)
+    - dp_budget_remaining >= 0 always
+    - evidence_coverage == 100 for any autonomous action
+    - If mpc_enabled THEN mpc_crypto_audit_approved == TRUE
+
+  This file is a starting point for formal verification in TLA+ tools.
+*)
